  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme to support peace efforts on local and international level (Salaam Support Group)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Based on lessons learned from the Salaam Support Group I project, UNAMA has streamlined the project&#xbf;s focus areas to ensure an optimal allocation of resources. The objective is to support reconciliation and peace initiatives with focus on local level cohesion, inclusive political settlements involving minorities and more.</narrative>
  </description>
